WEBVTT

00:00:27.770 --> 00:00:32.170
<b>Scorching</b>

00:00:27.770 --> 00:00:32.170
<b>Ping Pong Girls</b>

00:01:10.230 --> 00:01:16.840
But, as a senior, I want to impart
as much as I can to the younger members.

00:01:18.010 --> 00:01:19.350
Kiruka...

00:01:43.870 --> 00:01:48.830
<b>Twelfth Serve</b>

00:01:43.870 --> 00:01:48.830
<b>Together, We Can Go As Far As We Want</b>

00:01:48.830 --> 00:01:53.250
Second Day of Camp

00:01:54.090 --> 00:01:55.090
All right.

00:01:56.590 --> 00:01:59.180
That's it for joint practice.

00:01:59.180 --> 00:02:01.010
It's finally over.

00:02:01.010 --> 00:02:02.910
Another rough day.

00:02:02.910 --> 00:02:05.390
Free practice starts now.

00:02:06.100 --> 00:02:10.100
Try your best to overcome your weaknesses.

00:02:10.100 --> 00:02:13.730
If you have any doubts or questions,
feel free to ask anytime.

00:02:14.220 --> 00:02:15.370
What to do?

00:02:15.370 --> 00:02:16.890
What, you ask?

00:02:17.920 --> 00:02:21.790
Hey, if it's "free" practice,
maybe we're free to chill?

00:02:22.370 --> 00:02:24.830
We're still only first-years.

00:02:24.830 --> 00:02:27.000
It's vital that we take some breaks.

00:02:28.550 --> 00:02:31.250
Practice with me, Hokuto!

00:02:32.240 --> 00:02:35.030
We can do some
intensive drills together, okay?

00:02:35.030 --> 00:02:37.260
Okay, but stop squeezing.

00:02:38.100 --> 00:02:41.720
We're the only ones who lost
during that practice match.

00:02:41.720 --> 00:02:44.140
We put the team in trouble.

00:02:44.140 --> 00:02:47.390
From now on, we need to contribute more.

00:02:47.760 --> 00:02:50.760
You obviously have to practice your serve.

00:02:50.760 --> 00:02:54.020
You can probably work on <i>that</i> here.

00:02:55.440 --> 00:02:58.940
Well, yeah, this ceiling
should be high enough.

00:02:59.370 --> 00:03:01.270
Do your best, Hokuto!

00:03:01.270 --> 00:03:02.910
Stop squeezing.

00:03:04.060 --> 00:03:05.310
During the Mozuyama match,

00:03:05.310 --> 00:03:08.620
my opponent took advantage
of my poor long game to force errors.

00:03:11.510 --> 00:03:13.970
I need to raise the accuracy of my serve.

00:03:13.970 --> 00:03:16.640
I think your serve's pretty good, though.

00:03:16.640 --> 00:03:18.470
Pretty good's not good enough.

00:03:18.470 --> 00:03:21.560
I need to be able to place it
exactly where I want.

00:03:22.210 --> 00:03:23.390
Also...

00:03:26.990 --> 00:03:30.850
I think I need an ultimate serve
that'll get me aces.

00:03:30.850 --> 00:03:33.470
Ultimate? That sounds awesome!

00:03:33.470 --> 00:03:36.200
By the way, what should I do?

00:03:36.200 --> 00:03:37.900
Work on your fundamentals.

00:03:37.900 --> 00:03:41.230
You're a counter driver,
so you're naturally prone to errors.

00:03:41.230 --> 00:03:44.360
But you should be able
to make up for it with your footwork.

00:03:44.360 --> 00:03:48.970
Keep working on your basic footwork,
and you could be a real threat.

00:03:48.970 --> 00:03:51.660
The basics, huh? Sounds kinda meh.

00:03:51.660 --> 00:03:54.920
I'll give you company all the way,
so don't complain.

00:03:55.750 --> 00:03:57.530
Just reduce the errors you make.

00:03:57.970 --> 00:04:01.300
As a counter driver,
you're faster than anyone on the team.

00:04:01.620 --> 00:04:04.040
You could aim to be Suzumegahara's top dog.

00:04:04.500 --> 00:04:06.080
That's what I believe.

00:04:06.080 --> 00:04:08.640
Jeez, you're making me blush, Hokuto!

00:04:09.080 --> 00:04:13.180
You're the most squeezable
of anyone on our team, you know?

00:04:13.180 --> 00:04:14.430
That's not a compliment.

00:04:14.430 --> 00:04:15.520
Ice cold.

00:04:16.170 --> 00:04:18.230
Let's get right to work, then!

00:04:18.230 --> 00:04:21.050
The seniors are really up for this.

00:04:21.560 --> 00:04:22.350
Hey...

00:04:22.870 --> 00:04:24.200
No!

00:04:27.990 --> 00:04:30.620
But the tournament's almost here.

00:04:30.620 --> 00:04:35.120
To win, I have to abandon the forehand smash
and think of another way to get better.

00:04:35.120 --> 00:04:36.580
No means no!

00:04:36.910 --> 00:04:40.210
Y-You love hitting smashes.

00:04:40.810 --> 00:04:46.300
And it really makes my heart race
when I watch you nailing them.

00:04:46.300 --> 00:04:49.060
So, uh, I...

00:04:49.060 --> 00:04:51.060
I don't want you to abandon your smash.

00:04:53.190 --> 00:04:56.520
Anyway, you just can't give up on the smash!

00:04:56.830 --> 00:04:57.940
Koyori.

00:05:00.360 --> 00:05:01.610
Agari-chan!

00:05:01.610 --> 00:05:03.900
Work with me during free practice!

00:05:04.660 --> 00:05:08.810
I've been thinking about how to raise
the lethalness of your smash since yesterday.

00:05:08.810 --> 00:05:09.870
And, well,

00:05:09.870 --> 00:05:11.370
I hit upon something.

00:05:14.020 --> 00:05:16.640
Believe in me and follow my lead.

00:05:22.550 --> 00:05:23.590
Okay.

00:05:23.930 --> 00:05:25.800
Let's do our best, Agari-chan.

00:05:25.800 --> 00:05:26.740
Yeah.

00:05:27.190 --> 00:05:29.070
So, what should I do?

00:05:29.070 --> 00:05:30.700
First, take this pose.

00:05:30.700 --> 00:05:31.520
Like this?

00:05:31.520 --> 00:05:32.730
And then do this.

00:05:32.730 --> 00:05:33.640
Like so?

00:05:33.640 --> 00:05:35.140
Now stand up!

00:05:35.140 --> 00:05:36.310
Standing up!

00:05:41.050 --> 00:05:42.730
What are they doing?

00:05:42.730 --> 00:05:45.460
What the heck? That's a shoulder ride!

00:05:45.460 --> 00:05:47.240
Practicing for group gymnastics?

00:05:48.590 --> 00:05:50.150
Uh, Koyori?

00:05:50.670 --> 00:05:53.330
Will this really help
make my smash more lethal?

00:05:54.050 --> 00:05:56.850
You go by the moniker
"Driver of the North."

00:05:57.390 --> 00:05:59.970
In order to hit the best smashes,

00:05:59.970 --> 00:06:03.090
I think you should take advantage
of your trademark loop drive.

00:06:05.370 --> 00:06:06.680
What the heck is that?

00:06:08.200 --> 00:06:10.010
I don't know,

00:06:10.500 --> 00:06:13.280
but the seniors are giving it their all.

00:06:13.280 --> 00:06:15.850
We can't be the only ones slacking off.

00:06:19.000 --> 00:06:21.290
Everyone's hard at work.

00:06:22.770 --> 00:06:25.980
Now, I should get
to doubles practice with Kiruka.

00:06:26.300 --> 00:06:27.140
Captain!

00:06:27.140 --> 00:06:28.450
Teach us!

00:06:29.180 --> 00:06:30.890
Teach you what?

00:06:30.890 --> 00:06:33.050
I can't connect with my drives.

00:06:33.050 --> 00:06:34.780
Tell me how to get the hang of it.

00:06:34.780 --> 00:06:37.150
And I can't keep any rallies going.

00:06:37.150 --> 00:06:38.450
What should I do?

00:06:38.450 --> 00:06:40.000
U-Um, me, too!

00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:41.620
My, my.

00:06:41.620 --> 00:06:45.100
I can't teach you all at once,
so let's do this one at a time.

00:06:45.100 --> 00:06:46.460
Thank you!

00:06:46.460 --> 00:06:48.940
First up, Tanpopo-chan.

00:06:48.940 --> 00:06:52.870
Drives are less "hitting" the ball
and more "stroking" it.

00:06:52.870 --> 00:06:55.280
And the waist is key to the swing.

00:06:55.280 --> 00:06:57.300
You gotta do this, and this!

00:06:57.300 --> 00:06:58.360
Try it.

00:06:58.360 --> 00:06:59.040
Okay!

00:07:02.460 --> 00:07:04.020
Should you be doing this?

00:07:04.020 --> 00:07:06.360
Doing what?

00:07:07.590 --> 00:07:09.430
The tournament's right around the corner.

00:07:09.900 --> 00:07:12.910
Instead of focusing on your practice
at such a crucial time,

00:07:12.910 --> 00:07:15.330
all you did was teach the juniors.

00:07:15.690 --> 00:07:17.420
It'll be fine.

00:07:17.420 --> 00:07:21.290
I'm working on our doubles routine
with you, aren't I?

00:07:21.290 --> 00:07:23.240
I'm doing what I have to.

00:07:24.580 --> 00:07:27.000
Well, yeah, but...

00:07:30.570 --> 00:07:32.540
I was just like them.

00:07:33.720 --> 00:07:37.890
My seniors taught me a lot of things.

00:07:39.280 --> 00:07:41.630
They made me who I am today.

00:07:43.560 --> 00:07:46.670
Of course, winning in the tournament
is important.

00:07:47.400 --> 00:07:50.690
I'm not messing around
when I say I want to go to Nationals.

00:07:51.480 --> 00:07:58.200
But, as a senior, I want to impart
as much as I can to the younger members.

00:08:00.670 --> 00:08:04.360
As they practice a lot and get better,

00:08:04.820 --> 00:08:09.210
I'm sure they'll fall more and more
in love with table tennis.

00:08:10.780 --> 00:08:12.230
And as captain,

00:08:12.870 --> 00:08:15.810
nothing could make me happier than that.

00:08:17.820 --> 00:08:19.100
Kiruka...

00:08:19.830 --> 00:08:22.110
Besides, as I always say,

00:08:22.110 --> 00:08:24.850
I won't lose to anyone if I'm with you.

00:08:26.830 --> 00:08:27.620
Yeah!

00:08:30.980 --> 00:08:32.860
Seconds!

00:08:33.230 --> 00:08:35.820
You sure eat a lot, Munemune-senpai.

00:08:36.620 --> 00:08:40.990
I'm practicing hard,
so of course it makes me hungry.

00:08:43.620 --> 00:08:45.960
But more importantly,
I'm a growing girl.

00:08:45.960 --> 00:08:47.710
If you girls don't eat lots, too,

00:08:47.710 --> 00:08:49.340
you won't get bigger.

00:08:52.110 --> 00:08:54.180
Bigger would be one thing,

00:08:54.180 --> 00:08:58.220
but it'd be a problem if I got <i>too</i> big,
like you, Thong Panties-senpai.

00:08:58.220 --> 00:09:00.310
I was talking about height!

00:09:00.310 --> 00:09:01.660
Where was that directed?!

00:09:01.660 --> 00:09:03.600
Also, it's Munemune-senpai!

00:09:03.600 --> 00:09:05.820
It won't be any problem at all.

00:09:05.820 --> 00:09:08.660
You can put it to effective use like this.

00:09:08.660 --> 00:09:11.400
You can't call this effective use!

00:09:11.400 --> 00:09:13.630
Can I rest on your boob pillow, too?

00:09:13.630 --> 00:09:15.640
I would also like to take that chance.

00:09:15.640 --> 00:09:18.430
W-Wait! I'm eating right now!

00:09:18.430 --> 00:09:20.870
So you're cool with it
when you're not eating?

00:09:20.870 --> 00:09:22.860
That's not what I meant!

00:09:22.860 --> 00:09:24.110
That's our Boobyboob-senpai!

00:09:24.110 --> 00:09:26.700
Don't call me that!

00:09:26.700 --> 00:09:28.070
Jeez!

00:09:28.070 --> 00:09:31.190
Come on! Will you cut that out?

00:09:31.190 --> 00:09:33.230
These aren't your personal property, Kiruka!

00:09:40.800 --> 00:09:42.810
Third Day of Camp

00:09:59.170 --> 00:10:00.970
You go like this.

00:10:00.970 --> 00:10:02.790
Like this.

00:10:02.790 --> 00:10:04.270
Like this!

00:10:10.950 --> 00:10:12.380
Seconds!

00:10:14.360 --> 00:10:17.340
Fourth Day of Camp

00:10:28.170 --> 00:10:29.100
Nice.

00:11:02.720 --> 00:11:06.770
Final Day of Camp

00:11:06.770 --> 00:11:09.520
Free Practice

00:11:14.960 --> 00:11:18.880
Okay, enough!
That's the end of this training camp!

00:11:20.360 --> 00:11:21.930
It's over!

00:11:21.930 --> 00:11:23.200
Beam, beam.

00:11:27.190 --> 00:11:29.540
Gather round, girls.

00:11:30.160 --> 00:11:33.930
We have now completed
this camp's entire practice menu.

00:11:34.390 --> 00:11:36.040
Well done, girls.

00:11:36.040 --> 00:11:38.510
Thank you very much!

00:11:38.510 --> 00:11:41.160
Did you manage to iron out your issues?

00:11:41.620 --> 00:11:42.870
If you haven't,

00:11:42.870 --> 00:11:46.630
be sure to work on it during club
after we get back to school.

00:11:46.630 --> 00:11:49.280
The district qualifiers will start
before you know it.

00:11:50.980 --> 00:11:54.390
Once you're done with dinner and baths,

00:11:54.390 --> 00:11:58.450
you're free to spend the time
until we leave tomorrow morning as you wish.

00:11:58.450 --> 00:12:02.090
But be sure to get packed tonight.

00:12:02.090 --> 00:12:02.740
Right!

00:12:03.200 --> 00:12:04.630
All right, girls.

00:12:04.630 --> 00:12:06.530
Say your thanks to Nipponichi-sensei.

00:12:06.530 --> 00:12:08.950
Thank you very much!

00:12:11.580 --> 00:12:12.830
Okay, you're dismissed.

00:12:13.330 --> 00:12:15.510
Split into groups and clean up.

00:12:15.510 --> 00:12:17.280
Right!

00:12:15.920 --> 00:12:17.280
Time to clean!

00:12:21.440 --> 00:12:23.780
I feel like I'm almost there.

00:12:24.270 --> 00:12:27.270
Sorry I was so useless.

00:12:27.270 --> 00:12:29.680
Huh? No, you weren't!

00:12:31.320 --> 00:12:33.590
You were a huge help.

00:12:33.590 --> 00:12:37.150
You had your own practice,
but you stayed with me the entire time.

00:12:37.910 --> 00:12:41.630
But that's exactly
why I have to figure this out myself.

00:12:44.570 --> 00:12:45.600
Agari-chan.

00:12:51.540 --> 00:12:52.330
Huh?

00:12:53.180 --> 00:12:55.080
The lights are on.

00:12:57.910 --> 00:12:59.860
Wow, we can actually keep rallies going now!

00:12:59.860 --> 00:13:01.420
We did train loads.

00:13:01.750 --> 00:13:03.980
We were so dead after that first day, too.

00:13:03.980 --> 00:13:06.550
I'm not who I used to be back then!

00:13:07.060 --> 00:13:10.080
Behold Agari-senpai's trademark

00:13:10.870 --> 00:13:12.650
loop drive!

00:13:17.150 --> 00:13:18.400
What are you doing?

00:13:18.910 --> 00:13:20.980
Huh? Er, uh...

00:13:20.980 --> 00:13:22.820
Reviewing what we learned in camp.

00:13:23.480 --> 00:13:25.150
S-Sorry!

00:13:25.150 --> 00:13:26.710
It's fine.

00:13:27.200 --> 00:13:28.990
We're here to play, too.

00:13:29.990 --> 00:13:32.060
Koyori, help me set up a table.

00:13:32.060 --> 00:13:32.770
Sure.

00:13:34.070 --> 00:13:36.370
Um, use this one!

00:13:36.980 --> 00:13:38.330
Huh? But...

00:13:38.650 --> 00:13:39.960
Go ahead.

00:13:41.140 --> 00:13:45.090
In return, teach me
how to hit a loop drive.

00:13:48.450 --> 00:13:50.760
Stroke the ball to impart spin, like this.

00:13:51.160 --> 00:13:52.000
Got that?

00:13:52.000 --> 00:13:53.300
Y-Yes.

00:13:53.300 --> 00:13:54.680
Koyori, serve.

00:13:54.680 --> 00:13:55.850
Okay.

00:14:00.460 --> 00:14:02.350
Keep your eyes on the ball.

00:14:05.370 --> 00:14:06.330
What?

00:14:06.330 --> 00:14:08.920
Sorry, I'm just so happy.

00:14:08.920 --> 00:14:12.700
I've always wanted to learn from you.

00:14:13.420 --> 00:14:14.580
Really?

00:14:15.140 --> 00:14:20.150
I was hoping you'd teach me
a little during this camp.

00:14:20.150 --> 00:14:23.590
Why didn't you just say so?
We're teammates here.

00:14:23.590 --> 00:14:27.010
Could you teach me every so often, then?

00:14:27.770 --> 00:14:29.300
S-Sure.

00:14:29.300 --> 00:14:30.280
Yay!

00:14:31.540 --> 00:14:32.780
Koyori-senpai.

00:14:33.390 --> 00:14:35.750
I want you to teach me, too.

00:14:36.830 --> 00:14:38.780
I want to feel my heart race, too!

00:14:42.500 --> 00:14:43.270
Huh?

00:14:43.750 --> 00:14:45.540
The lights are on.

00:14:45.540 --> 00:14:47.240
Someone got here before us.

00:14:50.450 --> 00:14:51.390
Try playing it now.

00:14:51.390 --> 00:14:52.090
Right!

00:14:52.090 --> 00:14:53.370
Here it comes. Get ready.

00:14:53.370 --> 00:14:54.080
Got it!

00:14:54.080 --> 00:14:57.330
Loop drive!

00:14:57.330 --> 00:14:59.250
You don't have to yell it out loud!

00:14:59.250 --> 00:15:00.890
And lower your waist!

00:15:00.890 --> 00:15:01.790
What are you doing?

00:15:01.790 --> 00:15:03.230
Hokuto-san.

00:15:03.230 --> 00:15:04.170
Hana-chan.

00:15:06.460 --> 00:15:08.900
Ah, so that's what's going on.

00:15:08.900 --> 00:15:11.000
What about you two?

00:15:11.000 --> 00:15:13.710
We're here to go over our practice again!

00:15:14.130 --> 00:15:16.360
But this looks fun, too.

00:15:16.360 --> 00:15:17.720
Let me play with you!

00:15:17.720 --> 00:15:18.960
Hanabi?

00:15:18.960 --> 00:15:20.420
Hanabi-senpai?

00:15:20.420 --> 00:15:22.120
Doubles showdown!

00:15:23.100 --> 00:15:24.130
Hang on.

00:15:24.130 --> 00:15:25.230
That wasn't the plan.

00:15:25.560 --> 00:15:26.730
Here we go!

00:15:29.170 --> 00:15:30.490
Come on, Hanabi...

00:15:30.490 --> 00:15:31.880
One-love!

00:15:32.500 --> 00:15:35.030
That one was no fair! It doesn't count!

00:15:35.030 --> 00:15:37.220
Let's start over, then!

00:15:35.450 --> 00:15:37.220
U-Uh...

00:15:37.220 --> 00:15:39.160
Don't go too crazy, you two.

00:15:39.160 --> 00:15:40.710
What's going on?

00:15:40.710 --> 00:15:41.960
Is this...

00:15:45.080 --> 00:15:47.800
Your serve is always so nasty!

00:15:47.800 --> 00:15:50.010
It got nastier with practice.

00:15:51.150 --> 00:15:53.590
Hey, hey. What's going on here?

00:15:54.180 --> 00:15:55.840
Morning practice, except at night?

00:15:55.840 --> 00:15:57.380
Uh, well...

00:15:57.380 --> 00:15:58.470
They started...

00:16:01.620 --> 00:16:03.010
Tag, Hokuto!

00:16:03.010 --> 00:16:03.980
All yours.

00:16:03.980 --> 00:16:05.940
It's Hanabi-senpai now.

00:16:06.380 --> 00:16:07.980
Can she win today?

00:16:13.090 --> 00:16:14.600
Hey, that's cheating!

00:16:15.410 --> 00:16:16.410
Beam, beam.

00:16:20.300 --> 00:16:22.120
That's our Koyori-senpai!

00:16:24.080 --> 00:16:27.130
All right, let's do this!

00:16:27.130 --> 00:16:29.250
We're having a tournament!

00:16:27.130 --> 00:16:29.250
Camp Tournament

00:16:29.250 --> 00:16:31.090
Hang in there, Yomogicchi!

00:16:31.090 --> 00:16:32.220
Go on the attack!

00:16:32.840 --> 00:16:33.970
It went up!

00:16:34.530 --> 00:16:35.930
Will it land inside?

00:16:35.930 --> 00:16:37.390
Out!

00:16:37.390 --> 00:16:39.100
Jeez!

00:16:39.750 --> 00:16:41.350
What are you doing?

00:16:41.780 --> 00:16:42.600
Captain.

00:16:43.120 --> 00:16:47.060
Man, oh man, you all
sure do love table tennis.

00:16:47.470 --> 00:16:49.790
Everyone's taking part?

00:16:49.790 --> 00:16:52.280
Um, why don't you two join us?

00:16:52.600 --> 00:16:55.770
But we already took our baths.

00:16:56.210 --> 00:16:57.660
Wait, she's writing our names?!

00:16:57.660 --> 00:17:01.000
The captain and Munemune-senpai
are joining the fray!

00:17:02.370 --> 00:17:03.890
Come on...

00:17:03.890 --> 00:17:06.540
What's the problem?
This is part of camp, too.

00:17:12.710 --> 00:17:14.300
Beam, beam.

00:17:14.710 --> 00:17:16.510
Hang in there, Hokuto-senpai!

00:17:14.740 --> 00:17:18.640
Kamiya Agari

00:17:16.510 --> 00:17:17.960
Go for it, Hanabi-senpai!

00:17:16.570 --> 00:17:18.680
Quarters!

00:17:17.960 --> 00:17:19.060
You're so good, Agari-senpai!

00:17:18.260 --> 00:17:20.680
Tsumujikaze
Koyori

00:17:19.060 --> 00:17:20.680
Awesome, Koyori-senpai!

00:17:21.060 --> 00:17:24.670
The camp ranking matches
have reached the main event.

00:17:24.670 --> 00:17:27.400
These two will fight for the top spot.

00:17:29.970 --> 00:17:31.400
Just who will...

00:17:31.400 --> 00:17:33.820
...the goddess of victory smile upon?

00:17:34.290 --> 00:17:36.080
Best of luck, both of you!

00:17:36.080 --> 00:17:38.360
Well, take it easy.

00:17:38.360 --> 00:17:40.420
This was bound to happen, huh?

00:17:40.420 --> 00:17:41.910
Sure was.

00:17:42.360 --> 00:17:44.660
I'm not sure how we ended up here,

00:17:44.660 --> 00:17:46.370
but we're here,
so I'm going all out.

00:17:46.370 --> 00:17:47.830
Yeah.

00:17:55.160 --> 00:17:57.320
Whoa, they're both going all out.

00:17:57.320 --> 00:17:58.300
Sheesh.

00:17:59.560 --> 00:18:00.860
<i>This takes me back.</i>

00:18:01.270 --> 00:18:03.770
<i>Koyori was like this,
right from the moment we met.</i>

00:18:04.770 --> 00:18:07.290
<i>I thought she was just some clumsy girl,</i>

00:18:07.810 --> 00:18:11.020
<i>but she turns into a different person
when playing table tennis.</i>

00:18:11.840 --> 00:18:13.990
<i>She always makes my heart race.</i>

00:18:15.570 --> 00:18:17.600
<i>But I'll be the one to win!</i>

00:18:18.130 --> 00:18:19.410
<i>How's that?</i>

00:18:21.260 --> 00:18:22.780
<i>She returned it. Of course she did.</i>

00:18:23.640 --> 00:18:24.790
Agari-chan,

00:18:24.790 --> 00:18:26.700
I love table tennis!

00:18:34.070 --> 00:18:36.130
<i>Here I come, Agari-chan.</i>

00:18:36.130 --> 00:18:37.560
<i>Keep your eyes peeled.</i>

00:18:40.160 --> 00:18:42.390
<i>This is who I am!</i>

00:18:45.730 --> 00:18:46.560
<i>I'll take it head-on!</i>

00:18:47.770 --> 00:18:51.600
<i>This is my response
to the heart-racing ecstasy you gave me!</i>

00:18:53.900 --> 00:18:56.390
<i>This is who I am!</i>

00:19:04.140 --> 00:19:05.540
That was so fast...

00:19:05.540 --> 00:19:06.660
...I couldn't see it.

00:19:09.030 --> 00:19:09.820
I did it.

00:19:10.560 --> 00:19:11.540
That was...

00:19:12.440 --> 00:19:14.090
Agari-chan!

00:19:14.090 --> 00:19:17.020
Amazing! That smash was amazing!

00:19:17.020 --> 00:19:20.180
With it, I'm sure you can beat anyone!

00:19:20.180 --> 00:19:21.910
You did it, Agari-chan!

00:19:21.910 --> 00:19:23.540
Hey, Koyori?

00:19:23.540 --> 00:19:26.100
Awesome! You're awesome, Agari-chan!

00:19:26.550 --> 00:19:28.570
Talk about a surprise.

00:19:28.570 --> 00:19:30.640
That is some crazy progress.

00:19:30.640 --> 00:19:33.520
If she can learn to play that at will...

00:19:33.520 --> 00:19:36.290
...it'll produce tons of winners for her.

00:19:36.290 --> 00:19:40.850
Also, Koyori-chan didn't focus
on just returning the loop drive.

00:19:40.850 --> 00:19:42.330
She took it on with her smash.

00:19:42.330 --> 00:19:45.870
Seriously, what is <i>with</i> those two?

00:19:46.200 --> 00:19:47.620
Hooray!

00:20:00.310 --> 00:20:02.120
That feels good.

00:20:04.260 --> 00:20:05.980
Wh-What is it?

00:20:05.980 --> 00:20:09.720
Well, you looked down
when we first got to camp,

00:20:10.130 --> 00:20:12.390
so I'm happy you're feeling better now.

00:20:13.760 --> 00:20:16.420
I-I wasn't down or anything...

00:20:16.420 --> 00:20:18.630
Huh? You totally were.

00:20:21.030 --> 00:20:25.280
W-Well, assuming I do actually feel better,
it's all thanks to you.

00:20:28.300 --> 00:20:31.070
You gave me the key hint
to make my smash better

00:20:31.070 --> 00:20:33.750
and practiced with me...

00:20:33.750 --> 00:20:35.080
Agari-chan.

00:20:35.560 --> 00:20:40.590
S-So, uh, well...

00:20:40.590 --> 00:20:44.050
Th-Thank you.

00:20:45.580 --> 00:20:46.300
Sure.

00:20:48.070 --> 00:20:50.260
But I was just paying you back.

00:20:51.980 --> 00:20:56.310
You helped me find the sweet spot before,
so this was to repay you.

00:20:56.720 --> 00:20:58.930
Repay me, huh?

00:21:00.040 --> 00:21:03.720
Th-Then it's now my turn
to coach you again.

00:21:04.180 --> 00:21:08.320
You haven't perfected the use
of the sweet spot yet, have you?

00:21:08.320 --> 00:21:11.690
I'll coach you and help you perfect it.

00:21:12.670 --> 00:21:14.160
So we can aim ever higher!

00:21:15.870 --> 00:21:18.880
Then it'll be my turn after that.

00:21:19.220 --> 00:21:21.420
And my turn after that.

00:21:21.420 --> 00:21:23.550
And my turn after that!

00:21:25.500 --> 00:21:29.350
I want to keep practicing together
like that and getting better.

00:21:29.980 --> 00:21:31.810
Forget wanting to.
We're <i>going</i> to.

00:21:31.810 --> 00:21:32.830
Right.

00:21:35.140 --> 00:21:37.960
We should head back.
The bus will be here soon.

00:21:37.960 --> 00:21:38.940
Yeah.

00:21:46.400 --> 00:21:49.480
<i>We can get a lot better.</i>

00:21:49.480 --> 00:21:51.660
<i>We can feel our hearts race a lot more.</i>

00:21:52.480 --> 00:21:56.030
<i>Together, we can go as far as we want!</i>

00:23:06.190 --> 00:23:07.780
You can do it, Koyori-chan!

00:23:07.780 --> 00:23:09.900
It's all on you, Koyori-chan!

00:23:09.900 --> 00:23:11.780
Go, Taily!

00:23:11.780 --> 00:23:12.740
Peach Panties!

00:23:13.210 --> 00:23:14.990
Win, Tsumujikaze-san!

00:23:15.570 --> 00:23:16.950
Hang in there!

00:23:16.950 --> 00:23:18.200
Nom! Nom!

00:23:18.500 --> 00:23:23.080
Beat her to death, Tsumujikaze Koyori!

00:23:23.080 --> 00:23:24.670
You'd better win, Koyori!

00:23:24.670 --> 00:23:28.130
The only one you're allowed 
to lose to is me!

00:23:31.340 --> 00:23:34.150
I love table tennis!

00:23:34.640 --> 00:23:38.280
And I want to feel my heart race with you!
